<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.9600; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>三、纪律要求及注意事项</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">1.活动前，班主任要做好安全教育和调查工作，体质特殊和身体不佳的学生，不宜参加。参加和不参加的学生都要填写好“申请书”（“申请书”由班主任保存）。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">2.出发前以及返回学校，班主任都要组织专人清点人数；班主任活动中要随带家长联系电话，保证紧急情况下的即时联系。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">3.在步行过程中</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"><FONT face=宋体>，各班务必保持两路纵队，女生在前、男生在后。学生</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>必须严守纪律，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"><FONT face=宋体>不得相互超越，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>不得追逐打闹，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"><FONT face=宋体>不得私自离队，不得带手机，中途不得停留，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>严禁沿途丢扔垃圾。要做到一切行动听指挥，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"><FONT face=宋体>严格遵守集合时间。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>自备矿泉水。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">4.在景区自由活动时，注意安全，按时到达集合地点，整队步行返校。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">5. 每位学生穿校服，佩戴徽章，准备好运动鞋。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">6. 途中师生因身体原因不能坚持行走的，经班主任同意可由随队校车实施救护。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">7. 整个活动的组织情况由德育处负责评价，评价结果作为大型活动组织奖的考核依据</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">8.请假的学生务必在教室自修，请假名单请班主任提前交给年段长，不得提前离校。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: right; MARGIN: 0pt 28pt 0pt 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 126.95pt; mso-char-indent-count: 9.0700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=right><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">                 </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">   </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>德育处</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: right; MARGIN: 0pt 28pt 0pt 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 126.95pt; mso-char-indent-count: 9.0700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=right><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">                   </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">   </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">2017年11月 22 日</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 22.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.4800; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"></o:p></SPAN><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201711/2017112309125976.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201711/2017112309125976.jpg" width=2000 height=783> </A></P>
